  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Is it necessary for us to try on "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "clothes"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " before buying them?"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我们有必要在买衣服之前试穿吗？"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "clothes 是常考单词，学生一定要掌握其用法，及比较与 cloth, clothing 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "clothes"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 是复数名词，表示衣服，前面不能用数量词和不定冠词，但可以用 some, these, those, many, (a) few, a suit of 等词语来修饰。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "cloth"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 是不可数名词，表示衣料，布匹，前面只能用 a piece of, three yards of 等词语来修饰。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "clothing"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 是不可数名词，表示衣服，前面可以用 winter, articles of 等词语来修饰。常与动词 buy, donate, provide 等搭配。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
